      "case_id": "content-basic.jsonl:4",
      "type": "content",
      "input": "cjpm.toml 中如何配置 stdx 路径",
      "runner": "agent-command",
      "output": "在 `entry/cjpm.toml` 的目标平台 `bin-dependencies` 下配置 `path-option`，把 stdx 解压目录加入数组。\n\nx86_64 示例：\n```toml\n[target.x86_64-linux-ohos.bin-dependencies]\npath-option = [\n  \"${X86_64_OHOS_LIBS}\",\n  \"${X86_64_OHOS_MACRO_LIBS}\",\n  \"${X86_64_OHOS_KIT_LIBS}\",\n  \"C:/Users/zhangsan/MyApplication/cjnative/stdx\"\n]\n```\n\naarch64 示例：\n```toml\n[target.aarch64-linux-ohos.bin-dependencies]\npath-option = [\n  \"${AARCH64_OHOS_LIBS}\",\n  \"${AARCH64_OHOS_MACRO_LIBS}\",\n  \"${AARCH64_OHOS_KIT_LIBS}\",\n  \"C:/Users/zhangsan/MyApplication/cjnative/stdx\"\n]\n```\n\n如果还没有 stdx 包，先下载并解压：\n```bash\npython .agents/skills/harmonyos-stdx/scripts/fetch_stdx.py --platform all\n```\n\n建议把 stdx 解压到项目根目录下的 `cjnative/stdx`；如果同时支持模拟器和真机，也可以分别放到 `cjnative/stdx-x86_64` 和 `cjnative/stdx-aarch64`，并在对应 target 中配置对应路径。",
